# Performance

## Components
- Server Components default; minimize client bundle
- `dynamic(() => import(...), { ssr: false })` for Three.js scenes
- `loading` fallbacks for lazy sections

## Fonts
- `next/font` with `display: swap`, subset Latin + Romanian diacritics

## Images
- `next/image` with explicit `width`/`height` or `fill`
- WebP/AVIF formats, `priority` only for LCP image

## Data
- Fetch in Server Components or Route Handlers
- Cache with `unstable_cache` or `revalidate` when CMS connected

## Bundle
- Tree-shake Three.js imports (`@react-three/drei` selective)
- Analyze with `@next/bundle-analyzer` in CI (optional)

## Hydration
- Avoid hydration mismatch: no `window` in SSR, use `useEffect` or `suppressHydrationWarning` on theme html only
